</node>
<node id="Yachachikuq">
  <data key="d0">Yachachikuq</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Yachachikuq is a teacher or instructor, often depicted as traveling to different villages to teach.&lt;SEP&gt;Yachachikuq is a term in Quechua, translated as 'teacher'.&lt;SEP&gt;Yachachikuq is a term in Quechua, translated as 'teacher'.</data>
