<node id="Community">
  <data key="d0">Community</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A document section about community.&lt;SEP&gt;Community represents a group of individuals who share common interests, values, or experiences, often living or interacting within a specific geographic area.&lt;SEP&gt;The community is a social group that, along with the state, is responsible for protecting and supporting vulnerable individuals, such as children, adolescents, mothers, and the elderly.</data>
