<node id="Juez De Paz">
  <data key="d0">Juez De Paz</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Juez De Paz is a judge responsible for facilitating reconciliation and proposing solutions to parties in conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;Juez De Paz is a term for a Judge of Peace, who can be approached for a separation document.&lt;SEP&gt;Juez De Paz is a person whose name appears in the text.</data>
