<node id="Information">
  <data key="d0">Information</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Information regarding the victim's background is crucial for assessing the severity of violence, including the duration and frequency of occurrences.&lt;SEP&gt;Information, or 'información' in Quechua Central, is data or knowledge that provides understanding or context.&lt;SEP&gt;Information refers to data or knowledge that provides context or understanding about a particular subject or situation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1cf42a40dbb9b66b9afee3a75222b066&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d1ccfe4b83f56423b977d019c039df9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a6350c1b25a5bed16a0d8d9d3ccf6f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc716e0954e124b4dc91e47eeb297307</data>
