<node id="Judge">
  <data key="d0">Judge</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The Judge is a legal authority tasked with deciding on the outcome of a case.&lt;SEP&gt;The Judge is a legal authority responsible for deciding on matters related to family law, specifically concerning visitation rights and the best interests of children and adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;The judge is a central figure in the legal process, overseeing the enforcement of sentences.&lt;SEP&gt;A judge is a public official who presides over a court of law and who is responsible for making decisions in legal cases.&lt;SEP&gt;The judicial authority who can access information about the defendant's employment and financial situation through official channels.&lt;SEP&gt;The judge is an authority figure whose orders are to be followed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Judge is the person asking questions during the interrogation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5b09bb0835ed50431835376082319ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98cad864703dcbad2974ce0467df38da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0604117ca81571f6756389f256bfdfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c59dfd0a7722cdd48deb0ca97fc9d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16124d6449b88fab808ef02e8301fea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781f59a329200f5396c80bbd1c6c808f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d0de7afc8d73954eebbcc483bf0a6d</data>
