  <data key="d0">Sala De Lectura</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Sala De Lectura is a quiet area in a library for reading.&lt;SEP&gt;Sala De Lectura is a term in Spanish, translated as 'reading room'.&lt;SEP&gt;Sala De Lectura, or 'reading room' in English, is a designated area within a library or similar institution for quiet reading and study.&lt;SEP&gt;A designated reading area, such as a library section or study room.&lt;SEP&gt;Sala De Lectura is a term in Spanish, translated as 'reading room'.&lt;SEP&gt;Sala De Lectura is a designated reading area within a library.</data>
