<node id="Quechua Central">
  <data key="d0">Quechua Central</data>
  <data key="d1">language</data>
  <data key="d2">Quechua Central is a distinct language variety within the Quechua language family, primarily spoken in the central regions of South America, particularly in Peru. It is a significant dialect with a unique linguistic profile and cultural importance.

This language variant is characterized by its extensive and specialized vocabulary. It boasts a rich collection of terms, notably in the field of anatomy, and is currently undergoing a comprehensive compilation process to document its entire lexicon. Additionally, Quechua Central is known for its distinct grammatical structure, employing 18 consonants and exhibiting specific grammatical categories.

In terms of orthography, Quechua Central has a standardized writing system. It utilizes a unified alphabet and follows particular rules for writing consonants and compound words, as outlined in R.M. N° 1218-85-ED. This standardized system has facilitated its use in various domains.

The language is employed in educational contexts, with publications utilizing Quechua Central for intercultural communication and learning. Its unique linguistic features, especially the mathematical and scientific vocabulary, make it valuable for academic and scientific purposes.

Quechua Central's distinct characteristics, including its vocabulary, grammar, and orthography, have attracted the interest of linguists and scholars. The name "Quechua Central" likely reflects its central geographical distribution and cultural importance within the Quechua-speaking communities of South America.&lt;SEP&gt;Quechua Central is a language with a unified alphabet as per R.M. N° 1218-85-ED.&lt;SEP&gt;Quechua Central is a language variant with 18 consonants.&lt;SEP&gt;Quechua Central is a language with various terms related to anatomy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-788dc85c48105c56d3fc08f5255da461&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb554bbdad89e67833af1f94f7c0b23d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-947fcfbc2e830e58af6390516b8c4432&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2335f555172c656623b9d4b0db0ae0b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5a19eb016fe7fd0cb41ca7a1fdfb8a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d26e303f56b510c4e5a7d4512c0b6232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd345302457a0b0a9709022be2877a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dde981c3d7f06e1d4dbbf5b7317a91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d1ccfe4b83f56423b977d019c039df9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-900d568e789b2e5dc129227473e22ad1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18880b5cade8a78d88622df5542dc862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4235b2d6e435fd354b5e6cff6ce7a7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da44850c63cb61e520df8c588c587ed0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19987dbd76ce78527f079861eafb615&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d364753e678b22b3f4d135c76a8ab9fe</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
