  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Pensión alimenticia refers to the potential risk to the sustenance of the person providing alimony if they continue to comply with the obligation.&lt;SEP&gt;Pensión Alimenticia is a legal term referring to alimony or sustenance payments, particularly in the context of Spanish family law. It involves financial support for family members.&lt;SEP&gt;Pensión alimenticia refers to the potential risk to the sustenance of the person providing alimony if they continue to comply with the obligation.</data>
