  <data key="d0">Article 368 of the Penal Code</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Article 368 of the Penal Code addresses the crime of disobedience or resistance to a legally issued order by a public official, with penalties ranging from three to six years in prison.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8b08a136ff0b17a4cbed6181955b9e88</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1783968036</data>
