  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Penal Code is a collection of legal provisions that includes Article 149, addressing the crime of omision a la asistencia familiar.&lt;SEP&gt;The Penal Code is a legal document referenced for its definition of permanent and dangerous crimes.&lt;SEP&gt;Penal Code is a collection of laws defining criminal offenses and their punishments.</data>
