<node id="Food Obligation">
  <data key="d0">Food Obligation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Food obligation refers to the legal requirement to provide food as mandated by a court resolution, which is essential for family well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;A food obligation is a legal duty to provide food or financial support to another person, often based on a legal link or relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;The obligation to provide food is a legal requirement, with a specific order of priority for relatives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8b08a136ff0b17a4cbed6181955b9e88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c59dfd0a7722cdd48deb0ca97fc9d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f635078746a647bc509bfcbaf08bdc0</data>
