<node id="Obligation">
  <data key="d0">Obligation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Obligation refers to a legal duty or responsibility, often in the context of financial or familial support.&lt;SEP&gt;An obligation is a legal or moral duty or responsibility.&lt;SEP&gt;The concept of obligation refers to the natural duty of relatives to provide assistance, stemming from ethical and social foundations.&lt;SEP&gt;Obligation refers to a legal duty or responsibility, particularly in the context of providing support or assistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-67629480dd950ea554e1603b5480988f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d80cc2eeef6ca2518edabac4f237f40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baad7cf4a618f450499575c623604757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f2e0660bbd2b6136970934b1b421679</data>
