<node id="Ministerio Público">
  <data key="d0">Ministerio Público</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ministerio Público is a legal entity that impugned a decision and filed a casation appeal.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministerio Público is a government agency responsible for prosecuting cases related to false information provided by the demandado.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministerio Público challenged the decision on September 3, 2019 (page 21).&lt;SEP&gt;Ministerio Público is a public ministry mentioned in the context of legal proceedings.&lt;SEP&gt;Ministerio Público is an autonomous Peruvian state body responsible for promoting justice, defending legality, citizen rights, and public interests, both proactively and upon request.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministerio Público is a government agency responsible for prosecuting cases related to false information provided by the demandado.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ministerio Público challenged the decision on September 3, 2019 (page 21).</data>
