  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Juzgado De Investigación Preparatoria is a court that issued a resolution on August 27, 2019, declaring the dismissal founded.&lt;SEP&gt;The Juzgado de Investigación Preparatoria is a judicial body that made a ruling on August 27, 2019 (page 14).&lt;SEP&gt;Juzgado De Investigación Preparatoria is a court responsible for preliminary investigations in criminal cases.&lt;SEP&gt;The Juzgado de Investigación Preparatoria is a judicial body that made a ruling on August 27, 2019 (page 14).</data>
