  <data key="d0">Spanish Language</data>
  <data key="d1">language</data>
  <data key="d2">Spanish is a Romance language widely spoken in Spain and various countries in Latin America and around the world.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spanish language is a widely spoken Romance language, known for its rich vocabulary and diverse dialects.&lt;SEP&gt;Spanish is the language used in parts of the publication, such as the introduction and presentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Spanish is a Romance language used in conjunction with Quechua in legal and judicial contexts, providing terms for specific legal and criminal concepts.&lt;SEP&gt;The language used in the conversation, with questions and responses.</data>
