<node id="Venn Diagram">
  <data key="d0">Venn Diagram</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A Venn diagram is a visual representation of the relationships between sets, used to illustrate set theory and logical relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;A Venn diagram is a graphical representation of sets and their relationships, using overlapping circles or other shapes.&lt;SEP&gt;Venn Diagram is a visual tool used to represent and analyze relationships between sets.&lt;SEP&gt;A diagrammatic representation used to illustrate the relationships between sets, often in the context of set theory or probability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e839c62082efb86813a5a27fd2dfc4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47093ee0a15bed613718c57d60752485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d363c35ad0dfabc8403b827ece64974&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2328fbabe7e3d0414f8b5dd5fe2110a</data>
