<node id="Hucha">
  <data key="d0">Hucha</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hucha is guilt or blame, with 'hucha' being the Quechua word for 'guilt' or 'blame'.&lt;SEP&gt;Hucha is associated with wrongdoing or guilt, and their actions involve writing down these transgressions on a sheet.&lt;SEP&gt;Hucha refers to guilt or blame, indicating responsibility for wrongdoing.&lt;SEP&gt;Hucha is a Quechua Central word for sin or wrongdoing, indicating a moral or legal transgression.&lt;SEP&gt;Hucha is a Quechua Central word for sin or wrongdoing, indicating a moral or legal transgression.</data>
