  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tumpay is the action of blaming or holding someone responsible, with 'tumpay' being the Quechua word for 'to blame'.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumpay is a Quechua term, potentially associated with the act of accusing or blaming.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumpay is associated with the term 'culpar'.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumpay is an individual with an associated term 'Culpar'.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumpay is a person associated with the concept of 'Culpar'.&lt;SEP&gt;Tumpay is a person who advises against lying when accusing someone.</data>
