  <data key="d0">Parent-Child Relationship</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The parent-child relationship is a legal and emotional bond between a parent and their child, recognized as a fundamental right.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a10c47969bde293870692b12386abf6</data>
