<node id="Legal Proceedings">
  <data key="d0">Legal Proceedings</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal proceedings refer to the formal legal processes and actions taken to resolve disputes and make determinations regarding child custody, visitation, and support.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal proceedings are mentioned, emphasizing the mother's rights and the role of magistrates.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal Proceedings are the legal actions taken by a spouse to claim a share of the income of their partner.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal Proceedings are the steps taken in a legal case, including hearings, trials, and appeals.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal proceedings are mentioned, emphasizing the mother's rights and the role of magistrates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a10c47969bde293870692b12386abf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0316609c53848e02f3ae95df7bf25b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7bca4527b3e6238e521a5f546c3063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f2e0660bbd2b6136970934b1b421679</data>
