  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Tenencia Exclusiva, or exclusive custody, is a legal arrangement where one parent has sole custody of a child.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenencia Exclusiva is a custody arrangement where only one parent lives with the child, with the other parent having visitation rights.</data>
