<node id="Apercibimiento">
  <data key="d0">Apercibimiento</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Apercibimiento is a legal concept referring to a judicial requirement or demand for compliance, often accompanied by a warning of potential fines or sanctions.&lt;SEP&gt;Apercibimiento is a legal term for a judge's warning to comply with a mandate, threatening a fine or sanction. It also denotes a disciplinary measure where a judge or superior issues a written notice to an assistant, directing them to act accordingly.&lt;SEP&gt;Apercibimiento is a legal term for a judge's warning to comply with a mandate, threatening a fine or sanction. It also denotes a disciplinary measure where a judge or superior issues a written notice to an assistant, directing them to act accordingly.</data>
