  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Interpelación is a process where ministers are questioned by the Congress, requiring a written request and a specific voting procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;Interpelación is a legal concept involving a written request for clarification or explanation.</data>
