<node id="Parents">
  <data key="d0">Parents</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The parents are the subject of the conversation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Parents are a potential source of support and refuge for the woman.&lt;SEP&gt;Parents are the biological or adoptive caregivers of a child, and they have a legal link for food.&lt;SEP&gt;Parents are mentioned as being potentially obligated to provide support to their grandchildren.&lt;SEP&gt;Parents are individuals who may request alimony from their children under specific circumstances.</data>
