  <data key="d2">An author is an individual who creates written works, such as books, articles, or other forms of literature, and is entitled to exclusive rights over their creations.&lt;SEP&gt;An Author is a person who creates written works, such as books, articles, or poems, expressing ideas and stories.</data>
