  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Father">
  <data key="d0">Father</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The term for a father varies depending on the gender of the person being referred to.&lt;SEP&gt;Father is a male parent.&lt;SEP&gt;The father is a male parent who may be the victim of abuse or assault by his spouse or child.&lt;SEP&gt;The father is a central figure in the text, with questions about his occupation, residence, and relationship with his children.&lt;SEP&gt;The father of the children, whose occupation is being asked about.&lt;SEP&gt;The father is a central figure in the text, with questions about his occupation, residence, and relationship with his children.</data>
