  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Morales is a cited author who discusses the Chilean Supreme Court's evolving concept of 'alimentos' and its connection to changing societal needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Morales is a legal scholar or author referenced in the text, providing insights on Chilean law and food obligations.</data>
