  <data key="d2">Voko is a cited author who explains the French Court of Cassation's perspective on the provision of 'alimentos', including the evaluation of necessity by the judge.&lt;SEP&gt;Voko is the author of a thesis on private law, submitted in 2012.&lt;SEP&gt;Voko is the author of a thesis on alimentary obligations in private law.&lt;SEP&gt;Voko is the author of a thesis on private law, submitted in 2012.</data>
