  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Consejos Transitorios de Administración Regional is a transitional administrative body with jurisdiction determined by the Executive Power until the establishment of Regions and the election of their presidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Consejos Transitorios de Administración Regional is a regional administrative body in Peru.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a6b30b3ca763a498b5133bf537cbdd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6cb441b8eac68ed5bd85a8d479f909b</data>
