<node id="Símbolo">
  <data key="d0">Símbolo</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Símbolo refers to a symbol, which is a mark or character used as a conventional representation of an object, function, or process.&lt;SEP&gt;Símbolo is a term related to unancha.&lt;SEP&gt;Símbolo is a mathematical term for a symbol, translated as "unancha" in Quechua.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f8704474c11ff6f7d7d0a11efef0e02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-533dcc7ad2776c9bf8f55e7b6a1fe007&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df7c149c110d164dcd030a0585e9e45e</data>
