  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Unancha is a term in Quechua, a language native to the Andes region of South America.&lt;SEP&gt;Unancha is a concept associated with símbolo.&lt;SEP&gt;Unancha is a method for identifying the symbol of multiplication.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f8704474c11ff6f7d7d0a11efef0e02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df7c149c110d164dcd030a0585e9e45e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9abb9ac860c1738a5c49a162233933f8</data>
