  <data key="d0">Simétrico</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Simétrico denotes symmetry, a balanced and harmonious arrangement of parts or elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Simétrico refers to kallu and is an adjective.&lt;SEP&gt;Simétrico is a mathematical term for a symmetrical shape, translated as "kallu" in Quechua.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f8704474c11ff6f7d7d0a11efef0e02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-533dcc7ad2776c9bf8f55e7b6a1fe007&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df7c149c110d164dcd030a0585e9e45e</data>
