  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Simplificar is a process of making something less complex or more straightforward.&lt;SEP&gt;Simplificar is a verb related to takshayachiy.&lt;SEP&gt;Simplificar is a mathematical term for to simplify, translated as "takshayachiy" in Quechua.</data>
