  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Takshayachiy is a Quechua term, possibly related to simplification or clarification.&lt;SEP&gt;Takshayachiy is a concept associated with the verb simplificar.&lt;SEP&gt;Takshayachiy is a person who is asked to simplify the given fractions.</data>
