  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Power, denoted as 'elevar (a una potencia)' in Quechua Central, is a mathematical operation involving exponentiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Power, in mathematics, refers to the result of raising a base number to a certain exponent.</data>
