<node id="Equilibrium">
  <data key="d0">Equilibrium</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Equilibrium, or 'equilibrio' in Quechua Central, signifies a state of balance or stability.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium is a desired state in which individuals can enjoy a balanced and suitable environment for their life development.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium is a key aspect of shared custody, emphasizing the balance in parental rights, duties, and responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Equilibrium is a key aspect of shared custody, emphasizing the balance in parental rights, duties, and responsibilities.</data>
