  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fraction, or 'fracción' in Quechua Central, is a part of a whole or a ratio between two numbers.&lt;SEP&gt;A fraction represents a part of a whole or a ratio between two numbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Fractions are a mathematical concept representing parts of a whole.</data>
