<node id="Homogeneous Fraction">
  <data key="d0">Homogeneous Fraction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Homogeneous fraction, denoted as 'fracción homogénea' in Quechua Central, is a fraction with the same type of numbers in the numerator and denominator.&lt;SEP&gt;A homogeneous fraction is a fraction where the numerator and denominator have the same units or are of the same type.</data>
