  <data key="d0">Proper Fraction</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Proper fraction, denoted as 'fracción propia' in Quechua Central, is a fraction where the numerator is less than the denominator.&lt;SEP&gt;A proper fraction is a fraction where the numerator is less than the denominator.</data>
