  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hexagon, or 'hexágono' in Quechua Central, is a six-sided polygon.&lt;SEP&gt;A six-sided polygon with six angles, formed by connecting six points in a plane such that no three are collinear.</data>
