<node id="Interval">
  <data key="d0">Interval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Interval, or 'intervalo' in Quechua Central, is a range of values or a time period between two events.&lt;SEP&gt;A range of values between two given endpoints, often used in mathematics to describe a subset of real numbers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d1ccfe4b83f56423b977d019c039df9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2328fbabe7e3d0414f8b5dd5fe2110a</data>
