  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Closed interval, or 'intervalo cerrado' in Quechua Central, is an interval that includes its endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;A closed interval is a range of values that includes both endpoints, often represented as [a, b] in mathematical notation.</data>
