<node id="Abofetear">
  <data key="d0">Abofetear</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Abofetear is a Spanish term that translates to "to slap" and is associated with the Quechua term Ch'aqlay T'aqllay.&lt;SEP&gt;Abofetear is a term for the act of slapping or striking with an open hand.&lt;SEP&gt;Abofetear is a legal term for slapping or striking someone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78122525030a637c72069cc1e3addbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cf11ea6339c25bb582acf8bbc4ed063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a9029ff9c76adfa824683e741000e5d</data>
