  <data key="d0">Golpeado</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Golpeado is a Spanish term that translates to "hit" and is associated with the Quechua term Maqasqa Waykasqa.&lt;SEP&gt;Golpeado is a term for a person who has been hit or struck.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78122525030a637c72069cc1e3addbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cf11ea6339c25bb582acf8bbc4ed063</data>
