  <data key="d0">Pegar Entre Varios</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pegar Entre Varios is a Spanish term that translates to "to stick between several" and is associated with the Quechua term Waykay Waykillasqa.&lt;SEP&gt;Pegar Entre Varios is a phrase referring to multiple people hitting or striking someone.&lt;SEP&gt;Pegar Entre Varios is a person whose name appears in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78122525030a637c72069cc1e3addbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cf11ea6339c25bb582acf8bbc4ed063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-961fb2bc7b939faa1dea54d9fa2cc917</data>
