  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Golpear Con Un Palo is a Spanish term that translates to "to hit with a stick" and is associated with the Quechua term K'aspiwan p'anay.&lt;SEP&gt;Golpear Con Un Palo is a phrase for hitting or striking with a stick or similar object.</data>
