<node id="Divorce">
  <data key="d0">Divorce</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Divorce is a legal process that terminates a marriage, distinct from separation of bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Divorce is the legal termination of a marriage, often involving the division of assets and the determination of child custody and support.&lt;SEP&gt;Divorce is the legal termination of a marriage, which can be initiated based on legal grounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Divorce is the legal termination of a marriage, which can be initiated based on legal grounds.</data>
