  <data key="d2">Auto is a legal term or concept, possibly referring to a legal document or a decision.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto is a legal term referring to a judge's decision on the admissibility of evidence, rejection of claims, and the management of the trial process.&lt;SEP&gt;Auto is a legal term referring to a judge's decision on the admissibility of evidence, rejection of claims, and the management of the trial process.</data>
