  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Indigence refers to a lack of financial means and resources.&lt;SEP&gt;Indigence refers to extreme poverty, where individuals lack the means to meet basic needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Indigence is a state of extreme poverty or need.&lt;SEP&gt;Indigence is a state of extreme poverty, requiring legal support and assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Indigence is a state of extreme poverty, requiring legal support and assistance.</data>
