<node id="Clothing">
  <data key="d0">Clothing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Clothing is part of the child support entitlement, ensuring children have the necessary attire.&lt;SEP&gt;Clothing is a significant expense, suggested to be included in the calculation of child support.&lt;SEP&gt;Clothing is made from wool, including shirts, pants, ponchos, blankets, skirts, and sashes.&lt;SEP&gt;Clothing is a significant expense, suggested to be included in the calculation of child support.</data>
