  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Education is a crucial component of child support, providing children with access to learning and development opportunities.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is the process of teaching and learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is a crucial aspect of child-rearing, considered in the calculation of expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is the process of acquiring knowledge and skills through teaching and learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Education is a crucial aspect of child-rearing, considered in the calculation of expenses.</data>
