  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Child support demand refers to the legal process of seeking financial support for a child's needs, encompassing more than just food expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Child support demand is a legal process initiated by the mother, seeking financial support for the children's upbringing.&lt;SEP&gt;Child support demand is a legal process initiated by the mother, seeking financial support for the children's upbringing.</data>
