<node id="Alimentante">
  <data key="d0">Alimentante</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The alimentante is a person who provides financial support, with the amount determined based on their economic capabilities and considering their assets, properties, and other income while also accounting for their personal needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Alimentante is an individual with financial obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;The person who provides alimony, and whose obligation may be fulfilled through means other than a monetary pension.&lt;SEP&gt;Alimentante is an individual who is owed a debt by the deudor.&lt;SEP&gt;The alimentante is a debtor in the context of providing sustenance.&lt;SEP&gt;The alimentante is a person who provides financial support, with the amount determined based on their economic capabilities and considering their assets, properties, and other income while also accounting for their personal needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Alimentante is an individual with financial obligations.</data>
