<node id="Legal Process">
  <data key="d0">Legal Process</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal Process encompasses the procedures and mechanisms through which legal issues are addressed and resolved, including court proceedings and legal negotiations.&lt;SEP&gt;The legal process involves gathering facts about violence incidents, informing victims of the process, and providing psychological counseling and protection measures.&lt;SEP&gt;The legal process involves decrees and resolutions that can be challenged.&lt;SEP&gt;A legal process is a series of steps and procedures within a legal system, during which legal acts can be performed to affect legal relationships.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b7c7f4b075e7719e5980150cd54d9c5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-348be1a6664ab4ebc49c54df3833ba75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1737d4eb23782c61e93ff8842d586b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cc242dd64fc87b074ebd25ff5dea242</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
