  <data key="d0">Child's Right to Welfare</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The child's right to welfare is a legal principle that ensures children receive the necessary care and protection for their well-being, with the state committing to provide legal and administrative measures to fulfill this right.</data>
