<node id="Policies">
  <data key="d0">Policies</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Policies refer to the set of guidelines, regulations, and principles established by governments or organizations to govern various aspects of society, such as public services, social welfare, and children's rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Policies refer to the set of guidelines, regulations, and principles established by governments or organizations to govern various aspects of society, such as public services, social welfare, and children's rights.</data>
