<node id="Social Services">
  <data key="d0">Social Services</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Social services encompass a range of programs and initiatives designed to support individuals and communities, addressing various social issues and promoting well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;Social services encompass a range of programs and initiatives designed to support individuals and communities, addressing various social issues and promoting well-being.</data>
