<node id="Legislative Measures">
  <data key="d0">Legislative Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Legislative measures involve the creation and implementation of laws and regulations by legislative bodies to address specific issues and ensure the proper functioning of society.&lt;SEP&gt;Legislative measures involve the creation and implementation of laws and regulations by legislative bodies to address specific issues and ensure the proper functioning of society.</data>
