<node id="Administrative Measures">
  <data key="d0">Administrative Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Administrative measures refer to the actions and processes undertaken by government agencies or organizations to implement policies, manage resources, and ensure compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Administrative measures refer to the actions and processes undertaken by government agencies or organizations to implement policies, manage resources, and ensure compliance with regulations.</data>
