  <data key="d0">Adequate Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Adequate measures imply actions taken to meet the needs or requirements of a particular situation, ensuring effectiveness and appropriateness.&lt;SEP&gt;Adequate measures imply actions taken to meet the needs or requirements of a particular situation, ensuring effectiveness and appropriateness.</data>
