<node id="Rights">
  <data key="d0">Rights</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Rights refer to the legal, social, and ethical entitlements and freedoms that individuals possess, ensuring their protection and well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;Rights refer to the legal entitlements, privileges, and protections granted to individuals or entities, safeguarding their interests and ensuring fairness.&lt;SEP&gt;Rights refer to the legal entitlements, privileges, and protections granted to individuals or entities, safeguarding their interests and ensuring fairness.&lt;SEP&gt;Rights refer to the legal, social, and ethical entitlements and freedoms that individuals possess, ensuring their protection and well-being.</data>
