<node id="Economic Rights">
  <data key="d0">Economic Rights</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Economic rights encompass the entitlements related to financial well-being, employment, and access to resources, ensuring individuals can meet their basic needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Economic rights encompass the entitlements related to financial well-being, employment, and access to resources, ensuring individuals can meet their basic needs.</data>
