<node id="Social Rights">
  <data key="d0">Social Rights</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Social rights focus on the entitlements that promote social inclusion, well-being, and access to essential services, ensuring individuals can participate fully in society.&lt;SEP&gt;Social rights focus on the entitlements that promote social inclusion, well-being, and access to essential services, ensuring individuals can participate fully in society.</data>
