  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cultural rights involve the entitlements that allow individuals to preserve and express their cultural identity, heritage, and traditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Cultural rights involve the entitlements that allow individuals to preserve and express their cultural identity, heritage, and traditions.</data>
