<node id="Right to Existence">
  <data key="d0">Right to Existence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The right to existence is a fundamental human right that recognizes the basic needs and rights of individuals to survive and thrive.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c59dfd0a7722cdd48deb0ca97fc9d04</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1783971948</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Child's State of Need">
  <data key="d0">Child's State of Need</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The child's state of need is a legal presumption in some jurisdictions that a child is in need of support until they reach the age of majority.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c59dfd0a7722cdd48deb0ca97fc9d04</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1783971948</data>
