<node id="Presumption of Sufficient Means">
  <data key="d0">Presumption of Sufficient Means</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The presumption of sufficient means is a legal assumption that a parent has the financial resources to provide for their child's needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c59dfd0a7722cdd48deb0ca97fc9d04</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
