<node id="Justice Operators">
  <data key="d0">Justice Operators</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Justice Operators are professionals responsible for considering the circumstances of alimentantes.&lt;SEP&gt;Justice operators are individuals involved in the administration of justice, such as judges, lawyers, and legal scholars.&lt;SEP&gt;Justice Operators are professionals responsible for considering the circumstances of alimentantes.</data>
