<node id="Food Pension">
  <data key="d0">Food Pension</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A food pension is a regular payment made to provide financial support for food or living expenses, often based on a legal obligation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Food Pension is a financial support provided to children for their sustenance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c59dfd0a7722cdd48deb0ca97fc9d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1df6f6222656abe631b0f2df6aafaf86</data>
