<node id="Visitation Modalities">
  <data key="d0">Visitation Modalities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Visitation modalities refer to the different ways in which visitation rights can be exercised, such as with or without externalizing the child.&lt;SEP&gt;Visitation modalities refer to the different ways in which visitation rights can be exercised, such as with or without externalizing the child.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d85b4899031c6f4035d82c3302be488</data>
