</node>
<node id="Externalization">
  <data key="d0">Externalization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Externalization is a visitation modality where the non-custodial parent can take the child outside the custodial parent's residence.&lt;SEP&gt;Externalization is a visitation modality where the non-custodial parent can take the child outside the custodial parent's residence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d85b4899031c6f4035d82c3302be488</data>
