<node id="Supervised Visits">
  <data key="d0">Supervised Visits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Supervised visits involve a third party, appointed by the judge, to accompany the child during visitation periods.&lt;SEP&gt;Supervised visits involve a third party, appointed by the judge, to accompany the child during visitation periods.</data>
