  <data key="d0">Virtual Visits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Virtual visits are facilitated through online platforms, allowing for remote parent-child interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Virtual visits are facilitated through online platforms, allowing for remote parent-child interactions.</data>
