<node id="Relatives">
  <data key="d0">Relatives</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Relatives, within a certain degree of consanguinity or affinity, can also be granted visitation rights, considering the child's best interest.&lt;SEP&gt;Relatives up to the third degree are mentioned as potential recipients of alimentary obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Relatives, within a certain degree of consanguinity or affinity, can also be granted visitation rights, considering the child's best interest.</data>
