<node id="Third Parties">
  <data key="d0">Third Parties</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Third parties, unrelated to the child, may be granted visitation rights if it aligns with the child's best interest and legal principles.&lt;SEP&gt;Third parties are individuals or entities not directly involved in a legal process but whose actions or involvement can affect the legal rights and obligations of others.&lt;SEP&gt;Third parties, unrelated to the child, may be granted visitation rights if it aligns with the child's best interest and legal principles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d85b4899031c6f4035d82c3302be488&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cc242dd64fc87b074ebd25ff5dea242</data>
