  <data key="d0">Article 31 Of The Code Of Children And Adolescents</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Article 31 of the Code of Children and Adolescents outlines the consequences of violating visitation rights, potentially leading to changes in custody.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 31 of the Code of Children and Adolescents outlines the consequences of violating visitation rights, potentially leading to changes in custody.</data>
