  <data key="d2">Manan Piqpa Siminmanta Muchuspa Tukuy Sumaq Allin Ruwaykunapaq Huñunakuyman is the right to associate and form foundations and various legal entities without prior authorization, and they cannot be dissolved by administrative decision.</data>
