  <data key="d0">Normative Texts</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Normative texts are legal documents that outline the conditions for granting custody to one parent, while the other parent has visitation rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Normative texts outline provisions for child custody, stating that custody is granted to one parent, while the other has visitation rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Normative texts are legal documents that outline the conditions for granting custody to one parent, while the other parent has visitation rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Normative texts outline provisions for child custody, stating that custody is granted to one parent, while the other has visitation rights.</data>
