  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The Cónyuge Deudor is a spouse who is obligated to provide maintenance or alimony, as per Article 478 CC.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28ef892595b005185f05fed2db135474</data>
