<node id="Article 479 CC">
  <data key="d0">Article 479 CC</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Article 479 CC addresses an exception within the same bloodline, allowing primary obligors, like a child or parent, to transfer their obligation to the next in line if their own subsistence is at risk.</data>
