  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Intransigible indicates that a right cannot be waived or settled outside of court due to its personal nature.&lt;SEP&gt;Intransigible is a legal term suggesting that a right or obligation cannot be negotiated or compromised.</data>
