  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">World War II was a global conflict lasting from 1939 to 1945, involving most of the world's nations, and resulting in significant loss of life and destruction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d80cc2eeef6ca2518edabac4f237f40</data>
