  <data key="d0">State of Need</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The state of need refers to a condition where an individual is unable to provide for themselves, requiring assistance from others.&lt;SEP&gt;State of need is a condition where an individual requires assistance or support to meet their basic needs or overcome a challenging situation.</data>
