  <data key="d0">Hostage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Hostage refers to a person held against their will through force or threat of violence, typically to secure a debt or obligation, with the outcome dependent on the pressure exerted on the hostage.&lt;SEP&gt;Hostage refers to a person held against their will through force or threat of violence, typically to secure a debt or obligation, with the outcome dependent on the pressure exerted on the hostage.</data>
