  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The hostage-taker is the individual who seizes a person against their will, using force or threats of violence to secure a debt or obligation.&lt;SEP&gt;The hostage-taker is the individual who seizes a person against their will, using force or threats of violence to secure a debt or obligation.</data>
