  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Recidivism refers to repeated criminal behavior or the tendency of a person to reoffend after being punished or rehabilitated for a previous crime.&lt;SEP&gt;Recidivism refers to repeated criminal behavior or the tendency of a person to reoffend after being punished or rehabilitated for a previous crime.</data>
