  <data key="d2">Impúber refers to a person who has not reached the minimum legal age to marry.&lt;SEP&gt;Impúber is a term used to describe a minor who has not yet reached the legal age to marry, as defined by the law.&lt;SEP&gt;Impúber is a term used to describe a minor who has not yet reached the legal age to marry, as defined by the law.</data>
