  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Improcedencia de la Demanda refers to a legal situation where a case is deemed inadmissible due to the absence of procedural requirements or conditions for action.&lt;SEP&gt;Improcedencia de la Demanda refers to a legal situation where a case is deemed inadmissible due to the absence of procedural requirements or conditions for action.</data>
