  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Impugnación is a legal right allowing a party with a legitimate interest to challenge a decision by an authority, claiming it infringes upon their rights and interests.&lt;SEP&gt;Impugnación is a legal right allowing a party with a legitimate interest to challenge a decision by an authority, claiming it infringes upon their rights and interests.</data>
