  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sut'inyachiy refers to the act of writing a document with the intention of ensuring clarity and fairness for all involved parties, preventing future disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;Sut'inyachiy refers to the act of writing a document with the intention of ensuring clarity and fairness for all involved parties, preventing future disputes.</data>
