  <data key="d0">Impunidad</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Impunidad describes a situation where a crime or unlawful act goes unpunished due to various reasons, such as the perpetrator remaining unidentified, escaping, being pardoned, or due to judicial corruption or prescription.&lt;SEP&gt;Impunidad describes a situation where a crime or unlawful act goes unpunished due to various reasons, such as the perpetrator remaining unidentified, escaping, being pardoned, or due to judicial corruption or prescription.</data>
