  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mana Wanachisqa is a concept that signifies the absence of punishment for a crime, often due to the perpetrator's escape, lack of evidence, or other factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Mana Wanachisqa is a concept that signifies the absence of punishment for a crime, often due to the perpetrator's escape, lack of evidence, or other factors.</data>
