  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Imputabilidad is a legal concept referring to the ability of a person to understand the consequences of their actions and be held accountable for them.&lt;SEP&gt;Imputabilidad is a legal concept referring to the ability of a person to understand the consequences of their actions and be held accountable for them.</data>
