</edge>
<edge source="Derecho de familia" target="Derecho familiar peruano">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Derecho de familia is a broad legal field, with derecho familiar peruano being a specialized branch applicable in Peru.</data>
  <data key="d9">jurisdiction,legal specialization</data>
