</edge>
<edge source="Derecho a Alimentos" target="Derecho de Alimentos">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Derecho a Alimentos refers to the legal right to receive support, while derecho de alimentos refers to the corresponding obligation to provide it.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal right,obligation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-51b698b915327cdd4e7a202791944718</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783970709</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Alimentante" target="Alimentario">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The alimentante provides financial support to the alimentario, with the amount based on their economic situation.&lt;SEP&gt;The alimentante provides financial support to the alimentario, with the amount based on their economic situation.</data>
  <data key="d9">financial support,recipient</data>
