<edge source="Alimentante" target="Alimentista">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Alimentista receives alimony from the Alimentante, and their state of need is a central consideration.&lt;SEP&gt;The alimentante is legally obligated to provide sustenance to the alimentista, ensuring their well-being.</data>
  <data key="d9">alimony,legal relationship,need,sustenance</data>
