<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Article 149 of the Criminal Code">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Article 149 of the Criminal Code defines and prescribes punishments for the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal definition,punishment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974352</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Article 149 of the Peruvian Criminal Code">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Article 149 of the Peruvian Criminal Code provides a detailed legal definition and outlines punishments for the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal definition,punishment</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974352</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Legal Good">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The legal good, in this context, is the family, and its protection is the justification for the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">justification,legal protection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974352</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Active Subject">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The active subject is the person legally responsible for providing support and potentially committing the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal responsibility</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974352</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Passive Subject">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The passive subject is the person entitled to receive support and is the one affected by the omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal entitlement,protection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Objective and Subjective Typification">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Objective and subjective typification is the process of determining whether the elements of the crime of omission of family assistance are met.</data>
  <data key="d9">classification,legal analysis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Typical Conduct">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Typical conduct defines the specific actions or inactions that constitute the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">behavior,legal definition</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Non-Performance of Conduct">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Non-performance of conduct refers to the failure to fulfill the legal obligation of providing support, which is central to the crime.</data>
  <data key="d9">failure,legal requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Consummation of the Crime of Omission of Family Assistance">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Consummation refers to the fulfillment of all elements necessary for the crime of omission of family assistance to be considered complete.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal completion,realization</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Justification of Conduct">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Justification of conduct refers to circumstances that might legally excuse or mitigate the responsibility for the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">excuse,legal defense</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Criminal Law Justification">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Criminal law justification explains the reasons for imposing criminal penalties for the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal rationale,protection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974353</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Reátegui">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reátegui is cited to explain the legal nature of omission crimes and their connection to the crime of omission of family assistance.</data>
  <data key="d9">citation,legal analysis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974354</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Reyna">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Reyna is cited to present an objection to the crime's typification as a mere criminology of debts.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal objection,perspective</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
  <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d12">1783974354</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Omission of Family Assistance" target="Bernal">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Bernal's work is referenced to support the criminalization of omission of family assistance to protect the family as a matter of public order.</data>
  <data key="d9">criminalization,legal basis</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-127ae8b943be9ce7ac7a6f1a927830aa</data>
