</edge>
<edge source="Article 149 of the Criminal Code" target="Second Paragraph">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The second paragraph of Article 149 specifies increased punishments for specific scenarios of non-compliance with court-ordered support.</data>
  <data key="d9">legal content,punishment</data>
